OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after abuse of girl
OL,4,Athat began in 1999
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who subjected a young girl to
OL,7,F"horrific" sexual abuse that began in
OL,8,F1999 has been jailed.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said Gemma
OL,11,FBaker's abuse began when the girl was
OL,12,Fsix years old, and continued until
OL,13,F2003.
OL,15,FThe victim, who is now an adult,
OL,16,Fcontacted police in 2021 and told
OL,17,Fofficers that Baker, from Leicester,
OL,18,Fhad been careful to carry out the abuse
OL,19,Fwhen they were alone together, the
OL,20,Fforce added.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
