OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after abuse of girl
OL,4,Athat began in 1999
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaker - who had denied 10 counts of
OL,7,Findecency with a child - was found
OL,8,Fguilty following a trial on Thursday,
OL,9,Fand sentenced to six years in prison at
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
